## What

The Windows branch of the OS-version report in `Application::initialize` still calls `QSysInfo::windowsVersion()` and compares it with `QSysInfo::WV_None` (`interface/src/Application_Setup.cpp:930-934`):

```cpp
#elifdef Q_OS_WIN
        auto windowsVersion = QSysInfo::windowsVersion();
        if (windowsVersion != QSysInfo::WV_None) {
            properties["os_win_version"] = QSysInfo::windowsVersion();
        }
#endif
```

